 {"id":"fabro-8194","title":"Carry the implementer's prior diagnosis into gate-red bounce prompts","status":"open","type":"task","priority":2,"createdAt":"2026-09-07T18:58:15.338Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-07T19:19:56.855Z","description":"In workflow.fabro implementer node, add implementation_summary to preamble_allow_keys (or inject the previous pass's painpoints as a gate_bounce_notes key on the bounce path). In this run implementer@2's prompt excluded the node's own prior outputs, so it re-derived from scratch what implementer@1 had root-caused 90s earlier - 305s inference, 6,997 reasoning tokens, $0.405 (73% of the run's reasoning spend). Different mechanism from open fabro-6a78 (compact fidelity): this is the node allow-key/bounce injection path. Basis: run 01M1YJ8R820R7ZMSN55GJGMZ4A, workflow version 4ff76f32665f954e9a8e2027ec2a4a5b48266707730ae0620fcfd3f79acd4a10, commit b1dbce3b713540dc605bec39d9ac09c17a224cb4","labels":["revision"],"assignee":"fabro"}
 {"id":"fabro-56db","title":"Normalize stale mtimes at qualitygate start until the transport fix ships","status":"open","type":"task","priority":2,"createdAt":"2026-09-07T18:58:21.984Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-07T19:19:56.962Z","description":"In scripts/qualitygate.nu, at start run: find lib -name '*.rs' ! -newermt 2000-01-01 -exec touch {} + and mirror the one-liner in implementer.md step 4, until the fabro-22e4 sandbox transport fix is deployed everywhere. In this run edit_file-written push_credentials.rs carried mtime 1970-01-01 and cargo replayed stale dead-code warnings with wrong line numbers, forcing a manual touch detour; zero-LLM-cost mitigation, complementary to the open root-cause seed fabro-22e4. Basis: run 01M1YJ8R820R7ZMSN55GJGMZ4A, workflow version 4ff76f32665f954e9a8e2027ec2a4a5b48266707730ae0620fcfd3f79acd4a10, commit b1dbce3b713540dc605bec39d9ac09c17a224cb4","labels":["revision"],"assignee":"fabro"}
 {"id":"fabro-c841","title":"Tighten gate-bounce known-bug matching to error signatures","status":"open","type":"task","priority":2,"createdAt":"2026-09-07T18:58:22.097Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-07T19:19:57.075Z","description":"In .fabro/workflows/develop/scripts/gate-bounce.nu, require token overlap with the failure's error code/crate/file path instead of label-level matching, and emit {\"hits\":[]} when nothing real matches. In this run an E0432 cargo failure falsely matched prompt-refactoring seed fabro-4814, injecting ~1.4 KB of noise into implementer@2's and the reviewer's preambles. New iteration on the shipped fabro-56f4 mechanism (match precision, not match existence). Basis: run 01M1YJ8R820R7ZMSN55GJGMZ4A, workflow version 4ff76f32665f954e9a8e2027ec2a4a5b48266707730ae0620fcfd3f79acd4a10, commit b1dbce3b713540dc605bec39d9ac09c17a224cb4","labels":["revision"],"assignee":"fabro"}
